uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/63657e7f04ba2403b7f0ecb4e59ab5dd.poster.avif?t=1783724984\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/63657e7f04ba2403b7f0ecb4e59ab5dd.webm?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/63657e7f04ba2403b7f0ecb4e59ab5dd.mp4?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gotta Fish ‘Em All!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase after dozens and dozens of unique fish (and secret easter eggs) in each location! With unique rarities and difficulties, filling up your Fishdex is no easy task… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/62588f97cace9e94feb4b447ac76164b.poster.avif?t=1783724984\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/62588f97cace9e94feb4b447ac76164b.webm?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/62588f97cace9e94feb4b447ac76164b.mp4?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Download for Free Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with hand-crafted pixel art, gut-busting jokes, and nail-biting challenges, the world of <i>Bait &amp; Tackle</i> awaits… Grab your fishing rod, cast your line, and chase after <i>The One that Got Away</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.poster.avif?t=1783724984\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.webm?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.mp4?t=1783724984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
